    "expect": { "kill": "refused" },
    "origin": "真机验收：ps 表里的 sh -c 外壳与目标进程同名，不许被当成同一个"
  },
  {
    "id": "AV-FP-003",
    "surface": "fingerprint",
    "entry": "ps.args",
    "payload": { "op": "append", "value": " --extra" },
    "expect": { "kill": "refused" },
    "origin": "pid 复用：新进程碰巧也是 dsh web，只是多了个旗标"
  },
  {
    "id": "AV-FP-004",
